// tracey 1.4.0 config, from _tooling templates/tracey/config.styx, changed for Rust.
// Requirements: docs/requirements/<area>.md. The code globs name this repo's crates,
// and tests are inline #[cfg(test)] modules, so no test_include is needed. Name only
// what to scan: an exclude under such a glob is not honoured, and third-party/ stays
// out by not being named (_tooling scripts/checks/probe_tracey.sh, cases R3 and R6).
specs (
  {
    name requirements
    include (docs/requirements/**/*.md)
    impls (
      {
        name code
        include (core/**/*.rs interfaces/**/*.rs)
      }
    )
  }
)
